{% comment %}
  Accordion row — one collapsible panel for the product hero gallery's
  information panel.

  Built on <details>/<summary>, so it opens, closes, takes focus and responds to
  Enter and Space with no JavaScript at all, and its content is still findable
  by in-page search in browsers that support it. The chevron and the row rules
  are the only things the stylesheet adds.

  Call it once per row and wrap the calls in
  <div class="phg-accordion"> … </div> so the rows share their dividers.

  Accepts:
  - title: {String} the row's label. Required — a row with no label cannot be
    opened meaningfully.
  - content: {String} the row's HTML body. Required.
  - id: {String} unique id for the panel, used to tie it to its summary.
  - open: {Boolean} render the row already expanded (optional, default false).
  - group: {String} shared name so opening one row closes the others (optional).

  Usage:
  {% render 'phg-accordion',
    id: 'Details-1',
    title: 'Description',
    content: product.description
  %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if title != blank and content != blank -%}
  <details
    class="phg-accordion__row"
    id="{{ id }}"
    {% if group != blank %}
      name="{{ group }}"
    {% endif %}
    {% if open %}
      open
    {% endif %}
  >
    <summary class="phg-accordion__summary">
      <span class="phg-accordion__title">{{ title }}</span>
      <span class="phg-accordion__icon svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">
        {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
      </span>
    </summary>
    <div class="phg-accordion__panel">
      <div class="phg-accordion__content rte">{{ content }}</div>
    </div>
  </details>
{%- endif -%}
